OL,4,ANorthern Ireland to meet in Cardiff
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe will hold further talks with Swinney
OL,7,Fin the afternoon, with both men
OL,8,Fexpected to sign an agreement on
OL,9,F"future collaboration in areas of
OL,10,Fshared interest".
